  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>土地公</strong></span>，又稱<strong>福德正神</strong>，是中國民間信仰中廣受愛戴的神祇。作為特定區域——村莊、街坊甚至單戶人家的守護神，祂總是以身著傳統袍服、面容慈祥的老者形象出現。</p>\n\n<p>在《西遊記》中，孫悟空經常向當地土地公問路，這正是本模組的靈感來源。</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>現在你幾乎能在每個村莊找到<strong>土地廟</strong>，完美兼容<strong>Trek, Towns and Towers</strong>模組（可配置）</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">需搭配 <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lithostitched</a> 模組</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45385f86-60ea-4e45-a67a-afcef23acb81.png\"></p>\n\n<p>在廟旁放置<strong>火把</strong>進行祭拜，可獲得幸運效果</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6ab7d969-5e94-4565-9d28-28e09798b082.png\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>連續按三次Shift鍵</strong>召喚土地公</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_06fc2e89-e88d-4d3d-b3bf-2d134dd98a69.png\"></p>\n\n<p>可向祂詢問附近的地形結構或生態域</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_939be7d0-2b3f-474a-910c-ceb9274bc3e6.png\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1937e221-8e96-4a9f-92e4-9260ab42c0b1.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"237\"></p>\n\n<p>土地公將顯示目標位置，並召喚祥雲為你引路</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1113638e-af5f-427f-9730-8579226aee89.png\" width=\"432\" height=\"241\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20ee09c5-d8aa-44bb-a807-7765642a5110.png\" width=\"434\" height=\"246\"></p>\n\n<p>若安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Journey Map</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Map</a>地圖模組，將自動建立航點（可配置）</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_deb629c9-53e0-450c-bafb-e83d9660d162.png\"></p>\n\n<p>可自行建造土地廟</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2ddce85d-2961-4604-98b3-b6a5ce7167f6.png\"></p>\n\n<p>也可製作敕令符咒直接召喚土地公</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_284c353d-937a-458a-9324-aa0355dce7ec.png\"></p>",
